      "claim_text": "TechCrunch Disrupt 2026 AI Stage：聚焦定价、智能体安全与GTM新岗位",
      "material_id": "M-03",
      "source_excerpt": "TechCrunch Disrupt 2026将于10月13-15日在旧金山Moscone Center举办AI Stage，由Google for Startups呈现。议程将探讨模型商品化下的AI产品定价、需从基础设施重建的智能体安全，以及AI原生市场策略。Databricks、Decart、Luma AI和Clay等公司高管将参与讨论。",
      "source_url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/29/discover-whats-next-for-ai-from-the-saas-reckoning-to-the-agent-security-gap-at-techcrunch-disrupt-2026"
